		(descr "24-pin USB-C receptacle, two staggered rows at 0.5 mm pitch, 4 shell tabs; USB-C port. Pads measured in the bare front photo: the row nearer the mouth is B1-B12 from the top, the other A12-A1, which matches where VBUS, CC1, CC2, D+ and D- are traced. Wired: VBUS (A4, A9, B4, B9), CC1 (A5), CC2 (B5), D+ (A6, B6) and D- (A7, B7). The USB 3 pairs (TX/RX) and SBU are unused, as on any USB 2 device; the GND pins (A1, A12, B1, B12) join the ground pour; the shell tabs are not traced")
