		(descr "VFQFPN16, 3 x 3 mm; Single-cell Li-ion charger with an integrated power switch (up to 1 A). Its datasheet pinout matches the traced nets with pin 1 at the first corner outlined: VIN and VINSNS tied (1, 2), VOPRG grounded for 4.2 V (9), VOSNS on battery + (10), R14 on IPRG setting the charge current (15), R8 on IEND setting the end-of-charge current (13), C37 on VREF (12), R11 holding SD low to enable it (7), status output ST2 to the MCU (3), VPRE and IPRE left floating (14, 16). VOUT (11) and VOSNS (10) are joined by copper between the two pads, both on battery +")
