		(descr "SOT23-6 (DBV), 2.9 x 1.6 mm; Boost converter that makes the OLED panel's drive supply: identified by its 1C4F marking (TI's marking for the TLV61046A, a 28 V boost converter for PMOLED panels). Pads named by side and row from the top in the front photo; GND and the feedback divider fix the orientation: R1-R3 are pins 1-3 (SW, GND, FB), L3-L1 pins 4-6 (EN, VOUT, VIN). VIN the supply on the left button (pad 19), EN the +3.3V rail, VOUT the OLED VCC to BTB pin 12, FB the R25/R26 divider, SW the L1 inductor")
