		(descr "WSON-6 (DSE), 1.5 x 1.5 mm; Protects the battery: it cuts the charge or discharge FET on overcharge (4.275 V), over-discharge (2.3 V), charge or discharge overcurrent and short circuit. Its pinout matches the traced nets with pin 1 at the first corner outlined: VSS (4) on battery pad 2, the cell negative; BAT (5) fed from battery + through R9 with C2 to VSS; DOUT (3) with R35 to VSS; COUT (2) and DOUT drive the X3 charge and X2 discharge FETs, R6 and R7 return COUT and V- (6) to pack -")
